Relevant columns and their possible use  
• `posts_questions.title` : phrase “how …” must appear in the question title  
• `posts_questions.tags` : angle‑bracket list in which we must find at least one Android‑related tag (`android`, `android-layout`, `android-activity`, `android-intent`, …)  
• `posts_questions.view_count` : decide which candidate is the most viewed  
• `posts_questions.id`, `posts_questions.owner_user_id`, `users.display_name` (optional) : extra context when joining to the `users` table  
• `posts_questions.creation_date` / `score` (optional) : could be used for additional ranking or filtering


────────────────────────────────────────
Below are ten exploratory BigQuery queries, from simple inspection to the final answer.  
(Replace the project id if you have it aliased differently; every query is limited to 20 rows to stay light.)

```sql
-- 1) Peek at some question rows: id, title, tags, views
SELECT id, title, tags, view_count
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2) Quick check: how many questions carry any "android‑" tag?
SELECT COUNT(*) AS android_like_q
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`
WHERE LOWER(tags) LIKE '%<android-%';
```

```sql
-- 3) Distinct Android‑flavoured tags that actually occur
SELECT DISTINCT tag
FROM (
  SELECT tag
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`,
       UNNEST(REGEXP_EXTRACT_ALL(tags, r'[^<>]+')) AS tag
  WHERE STARTS_WITH(tag, 'android')
)
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4) Titles beginning with the word "How" (case‑insensitive)
SELECT id, title
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`
WHERE REGEXP_CONTAINS(LOWER(title), r'^how\b')
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5) Combine “How …” titles with any Android‑related tag, show some of them
SELECT id, title, tags
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`
WHERE REGEXP_CONTAINS(LOWER(title), r'\bhow\b')
  AND LOWER(tags) LIKE '%android%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6) Same as #5 but order by view count
SELECT id, title, view_count
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`
WHERE REGEXP_CONTAINS(LOWER(title), r'\bhow\b')
  AND LOWER(tags) LIKE '%android%'
ORDER BY view_count DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7) Use UNNEST so we can match on a cleaner tag list
WITH android_tags AS (
  SELECT id, title, view_count,
         UNNEST(REGEXP_EXTRACT_ALL(tags, r'[^<>]+')) AS single_tag
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`
)
SELECT id, title, view_count
FROM android_tags
WHERE single_tag IN (
  'android', 'android-layout', 'android-activity',
  'android-intent', 'android-fragment', 'android-studio',
  'android-recyclerview', 'android-listview'
)
  AND REGEXP_CONTAINS(LOWER(title), r'\bhow\b')
ORDER BY view_count DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8) Same logic as #7 but also show who asked the question
WITH cand AS (
  SELECT q.id, q.title, q.view_count, q.owner_user_id
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q,
       UNNEST(REGEXP_EXTRACT_ALL(q.tags, r'[^<>]+')) AS t
  WHERE t IN ('android', 'android-layout', 'android-activity',
              'android-intent', 'android-fragment', 'android-studio',
              'android-recyclerview', 'android-listview')
    AND REGEXP_CONTAINS(LOWER(q.title), r'\bhow\b')
)
SELECT cand.id, cand.title, cand.view_count,
       u.display_name
FROM cand
LEFT JOIN `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.users` AS u
ON cand.owner_user_id = u.id
ORDER BY cand.view_count DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9) What is the maximum view_count among candidate questions?
WITH cand AS (
  SELECT view_count
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q,
       UNNEST(REGEXP_EXTRACT_ALL(q.tags, r'[^<>]+')) AS t
  WHERE t IN ('android', 'android-layout', 'android-activity',
              'android-intent', 'android-fragment', 'android-studio',
              'android-recyclerview', 'android-listview')
    AND REGEXP_CONTAINS(LOWER(q.title), r'\bhow\b')
)
SELECT MAX(view_count) AS max_views
FROM cand;
```

```sql
-- 10) FINAL ANSWER: title of the single most‑viewed “how” question about Android
SELECT title
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q
WHERE REGEXP_CONTAINS(LOWER(q.title), r'\bhow\b')
  AND (
        SELECT COUNTIF(t IN ('android', 'android-layout', 'android-activity',
                             'android-intent', 'android-fragment', 'android-studio',
                             'android-recyclerview', 'android-listview'))
        FROM UNNEST(REGEXP_EXTRACT_ALL(q.tags, r'[^<>]+')) AS t
      ) > 0
ORDER BY view_count DESC
LIMIT 1;
```

